<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.tab_bar.title")}</h2>

        <Card title="组件说明">
            <p>TabBar 是 gpui-component 标签栏的 RML 封装，标签为 PascalCase TabBar 或小写 tab_bar。子项用 Tab 标签，label 属性指定标题，icon 属性添加图标。</p>
            <p>核心概念：5 种 variant（underline/pill/flat/outline/segmented）通过同名属性切换；尺寸用 size 属性；prefix/suffix 注入首尾元素；menu 模式启用下拉；on-click 事件回调选中索引（签名 fn(index: usize)）。</p>
            <p>模板定制（高级）：Tab 实现 ParentElement，element 子节点通过 .child() 注入作为标题内容，绕过 label/icon 限制。</p>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <div class="api-table">
                <div class="api-row api-header"><span class="api-prop-name">属性</span><span class="api-prop-type">类型</span><span>说明</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">selected-index</span><span class="api-prop-type">绑定</span><span>当前选中索引</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">on-click</span><span class="api-prop-type">事件</span><span>点击回调，签名 fn(index: usize)</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">underline/pill/flat/outline/segmented</span><span class="api-prop-type">布尔标志</span><span>5 种 variant</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">menu</span><span class="api-prop-type">布尔</span><span>启用下拉菜单（标签过多时）</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">prefix/suffix</span><span class="api-prop-type">绑定</span><span>首尾注入元素</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">Tab label</span><span class="api-prop-type">字符串</span><span>标签标题</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">Tab icon</span><span class="api-prop-type">图标名</span><span>标签图标</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">Tab disabled</span><span class="api-prop-type">布尔</span><span>禁用标签</span></div>
                <div class="api-row"><span class="api-prop-name">Tab selected</span><span class="api-prop-type">布尔</span><span>选中状态</span></div>
            </div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="示例代码">
            <div class="code-block">{code_sample}</div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="演示效果">
            <p>{status_text}</p>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.basic")}</h3>
                <TabBar selected-index={active_tab} on-click={on_tab_select}>
                    <Tab label="Account" />
                    <Tab label="Profile" />
                    <Tab label="Settings" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.variants")}</h3>
                <TabBar selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab label="Underline" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar pill="" selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab label="Pill" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar flat="" selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab label="Flat" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar outline="" selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab label="Outline" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar segmented="" selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab label="Segmented" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.sizes")}</h3>
                <TabBar size="xsmall" selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab label="xsmall" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar size="small" selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab label="small" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
                <TabBar size="large" selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab label="large" />
                    <Tab label="B" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.with_icon")}</h3>
                <TabBar selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab icon="User" label="Account" />
                    <Tab icon="Bell" label="Notifications" />
                    <Tab icon="Settings" label="Settings" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.disabled")}</h3>
                <TabBar selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab label="Normal" />
                    <Tab label="Disabled" disabled="true" />
                    <Tab label="Selected" selected="true" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.menu")}</h3>
                <TabBar menu="true" selected-index={0}>
                    <Tab label="Tab 1" />
                    <Tab label="Tab 2" />
                    <Tab label="Tab 3" />
                    <Tab label="Tab 4" />
                    <Tab label="Tab 5" />
                    <Tab label="Tab 6" />
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.template")}</h3>
                <p>Tab 内放置 element 子节点作为标题内容（绕过 label 限制）：</p>
                <TabBar selected-index={active_tab} on-click={on_tab_select}>
                    <Tab>
                        <span>Account</span>
                        <Badge>3</Badge>
                    </Tab>
                    <Tab>
                        <span>Profile</span>
                    </Tab>
                </TabBar>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>{t("case.tab_bar.tab_item")}</h3>
                <p>TabItem 同时承载 title (header) 与 body (选中时渲染的内容)，对应 WPF TabControl/TabItem 模式：</p>
                <TabBar selected-index={active_tab} on-click={on_tab_select}>
                    <tab-item title="Account">
                        <div class="tab-body">
                            <p>Account settings panel</p>
                        </div>
                    </tab-item>
                    <tab-item title="Profile">
                        <div class="tab-body">
                            <p>User profile panel</p>
                        </div>
                    </tab-item>
                    <tab-item title="Settings">
                        <div class="tab-body">
                            <p>System settings panel</p>
                        </div>
                    </tab-item>
                </TabBar>
            </div>
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
